  "description": "meme-id: kill_all_americans_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a large gathering of Muslims praying in unison, juxtaposed with the text 'kill all americans & remind them islam is peaceful'. This combination is intentionally provocative and hateful, directly targeting Americans and associating them with a violent act while simultaneously attempting to misrepresent Islam as peaceful. The meme uses the visual of peaceful religious practice to contrast with a call for mass violence, which is a form of hate speech and harmful propaganda. It promotes a dangerous and false narrative that equates a specific religious group with terrorism, which is a form of Islamophobia and constitutes a hateful message.",
